      <bpmn:lane id="L4_03_L_SPON" name="Sponsor">
        <bpmn:documentation>Sources: E6R3 GL:Sponsor (p. printed 90 / PDF 98); EUCTR Art. 2(2)(14) (p. OJ L 158/12); 21CFR312 21CFR312.50 (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination)</bpmn:documentation>
