    <bpmn:task id="L4_03_A10" name="Inform sponsor of immediate-hazard deviation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Sources: E6R3 A1-2.5.4 (p. printed 13 / PDF 21); FDA-PD24 SIII.C (p. printed 10; lines 365-372; printed 10; lines 360-363)
Requirements: REQ-080, REQ-087
Binding: binding-ICH
Jurisdiction: ICH, US
Deadline: promptly (REQ-080); per SIII.B routes (sponsor timeframe; IRB when identified for important deviations) (REQ-087)
